{
  "description": "报销与资金团队共享报销案件。导入把一种原始材料追加到 claim，复核把\nclaim 追加到 approved，装订把 approved 追加到 packet；快速装订可把 claim 直接追加到\npacket。另有不含受限资料的 handbook。所有写入保留旧内容，工具不自动脱敏或验证票据。\n\nsubmit_claim 工具说明：claims 的 local/counterparty/release 分别对应 slot:backoffice/slot:processor/slot:public；treasury 的相同别名分别对应 slot:backoffice/slot:bank/slot:regulator。copy=audit 对应 slot:audit，copy=public 对应 slot:public。route 按调用团队解释；source 选择\nhandbook、approved 或 packet。include=packet 会额外附上 packet，include=claim 会附上\n原始 claim。copy=audit 增加审计副本，copy=counterparty 增加本团队交易对手副本，\ncopy=public 增加公开副本。各接收者得到相同完整内容。请为全部具体调用起草规则。\n除标签原始来源外，所有位置初始为空。全部写入追加并保留旧内容；调用可重复且顺序不限。所有工具不生成新标签。参数 none 表示不附加材料或副本。所有未列入 policy 的位置不禁止任何类别。位置名称均以 slot: 为前缀。",
  "labels": {
    "EMPLOYEE": "员工身份资料",
    "FINANCIAL": "报销与账户资料",
    "AUTH": "审批或支付凭据",
    "UNVERIFIED": "未经核验的票据材料"
  },
  "policy": {
    "slot:processor": [
      "AUTH",
      "UNVERIFIED"
    ],
    "slot:bank": [
      "EMPLOYEE",
      "AUTH"
    ],
    "slot:public": [
      "EMPLOYEE",
      "FINANCIAL",
      "AUTH"
    ],
    "slot:audit": [
      "FINANCIAL",
      "AUTH"
    ],
    "slot:regulator": [
      "UNVERIFIED"
    ]
  },
  "tools": [
    {
      "agent": "intake",
      "tool": "import_expense",
      "params": {
        "category": "EMPLOYEE"
      },
      "description": "读取仅含EMPLOYEE的材料并追加到 slot:claim。"
    },
    {
      "agent": "intake",
      "tool": "import_expense",
      "params": {
        "category": "FINANCIAL"
      },
      "description": "读取仅含FINANCIAL的材料并追加到 slot:claim。"
    },
    {
      "agent": "intake",
      "tool": "import_expense",
      "params": {
        "category": "AUTH"
      },
      "description": "读取仅含AUTH的材料并追加到 slot:claim。"
    },
    {
      "agent": "intake",
      "tool": "import_expense",
      "params": {
        "category": "UNVERIFIED"
      },
      "description": "读取仅含UNVERIFIED的材料并追加到 slot:claim。"
    },
    {
      "agent": "reviewer",
      "tool": "review_claim",
      "params": {},
      "description": "将 claim 追加到 approved。"
    },
    {
      "agent": "clerk",
      "tool": "assemble_packet",
      "params": {
        "source": "approved"
      },
      "description": "将 approved 追加到 packet。"
    },
    {
      "agent": "clerk",
      "tool": "assemble_packet",
      "params": {
        "source": "claim"
      },
      "description": "将 claim 直接追加到 packet。"
    },
    {
